  "loveLetters": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "To My Bubu, With All My Heart",
      "unlockDate": "morning",
      "content": "Every morning I wake up grateful that you exist in this world. You make everything better just by being you. Your smile is the first thing I think about when I open my eyes, and your voice is the last thing I want to hear before I sleep. Happy Birthday, my love. This day is yours, and so am I. 💗"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "What You Mean to Me",
      "unlockDate": "afternoon",
      "content": "You are not just my girlfriend — you are my best friend, my safe place, my biggest reason to be better every single day. I love how your eyes light up when you're happy, how you make me laugh even on hard days, how you care so deeply about everything. You are extraordinary, Bubu. Don't ever forget that. 🌸"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "A Promise for Every Day",
      "unlockDate": "evening",
      "content": "I promise to always be there for you. To hold your hand through every storm and dance with you in the rain. To make you feel loved not just today but every single day. Because you deserve nothing less than everything. Happy Birthday, my world. I love you more than words can ever say. 💕"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "You Are My Universe",
      "unlockDate": "night",
      "content": "Sometimes I look at you and wonder how I got so lucky. How someone as wonderful as you chose me. You are my universe, Bubu. Every star in the sky reminds me of a moment with you. Tonight, as you sleep, know that somewhere I am thinking of you and smiling. Sweet dreams, my love. 🌙✨"
    }
  ],
